{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香港童軍總會與三間大專院校簽署合作備忘錄，未來會向童軍青年提供生涯規劃課程。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SCOUT-1730_001.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026CwMzWkAjQb1787998576.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SCOUT-1730_001.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">中大商學院、恒大傳播學院及東華學院在未來三年，會向童軍青年提供生涯規劃課程，內容涵蓋創業實踐、醫療輔助專業等領域。每個課程為期約一個月，按需要在童軍中心或各院校授課，並由相關學院師資教授。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.SCOUT-1730_002.jpg\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026bX0Kzz4IHN1787998593.jpg\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"Picture_J.SCOUT-1730_002.jpg\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">總會指，童軍成員可報讀全部課程，合資格成員可獲資助部分費用，期望計劃能提升青少年未來就業競爭力，預計有逾200人受惠。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-29T10:38:15.779436+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":193,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}